# Secrets. DATABASE_URL, AUTH_SECRET, BOT_API_KEY and OFFICE_USERS belong in
# Vercel's environment variables and in a local .env.local that never leaves
# this machine. A password hash is not a password, but OFFICE_USERS is still
# the list of who can sign in — keep it out of the repo even so.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.DS_Store
*.log
.vercel
